<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-4-piece" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This set retains the 4pc Protection Tier Set Bonus; the performance of the bonus is highly dependent on finding cases to exploit its interaction with Eternal Flame. Trinket slots are highly flexible and should be used to react to circumstances: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105568/vial-of-living-corruption">
<img alt="Vial of Living Corruption" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vial of Living Corruption</span></a> can be swapped to an offensive trinket such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105632/skeers-bloodsoaked-talisman">
<img alt="Skeer's Bloodsoaked Talisman" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skeer's Bloodsoaked Talisman</span></a>, and subbing in a second defensive trinket such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105645/curse-of-hubris">
<img alt="Curse of Hubris" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Curse of Hubris</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=102706/prideful-gladiators-emblem-of-tenacity">
<img alt="Prideful Gladiator's Emblem of Tenacity" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_endlessrage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Prideful Gladiator's Emblem of Tenacity</span></a> can provide a cheeky additional cooldown without hurting any of your caps. <br/>
<br/>Despite picking up a lot of damage-oriented items, the set can be made very tanky with conservative reforges and enchants, meaning the majority of those items can also be re-used for more damage-oriented setups once content is on farm.<br/>
