<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="set-bonuses">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_chest_plate_raidpaladin_l_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Protection Paladins in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The Tier 16 Protection Tier set bonuses are interesting and, given the right circumstance, very powerful. The 2-piece bonus extends the usefulness of Divine Protection by adding another substantial healing effect afterwards. The 4-piece bonus will instead allow you to use <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=114163/eternal-flame">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_torch_thrown.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eternal Flame</span></a> more freely by removing its Holy Power cost when used rotationally; however, its usefulness with baseline <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=130551/word-of-glory">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_96.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Word of Glory</span></a> is much reduced.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-16-tank">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 16 Protection - <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item-set=1188/plate-of-winged-triumph">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Plate of Winged Triumph</span></a></span></h3>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
<table class="exclude-units grid" style="width: 500px; max-width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c2" style="width: 30%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Set Count</b></td>
<td data-background="c2">
<b>Bonus</b></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>2 Piece</td>
<td>
<span>While Divine Protection is active, 75% of the damage taken is converted into a heal over time that activates when Divine Protection fades.</span></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>4 Piece</td>
<td>
<span>While at 3 or more stacks of Bastion of Glory, your next [Eternal Flame /<wbr/> Word of Glory] will consume no Holy Power and count as if 3 Holy Power were consumed.</span></td></tr>
<tr>
