<del></del></span> Legendary Cloak for Protection Paladins</span></h2>There are six Legendary cloaks available with four unique proc effects; for Protection Paladins, the choice is between the following two versions:<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
<table border="1" cellpadding="5" class="exclude-units markup-table-clean-borders" style="background:#222222;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center; width: 25%; max-width: 100%;">
<a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=102250/qian-ying-fortitude-of-niuzao">
<img alt="Qian-Ying, Fortitude of Niuzao" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_oxtank_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Qian-Ying, Fortitude of Niuzao</span></a></td>
<td style="text-align: center; width: 25%; max-width: 100%;">
<a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=102249/gong-lu-strength-of-xuen">
